      "text": {
        "id": "Fokus latihan",
        "en": "Practice focus"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.basic-tajwid-intro",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "id": "Ini pengantar; pengajar kompeten perlu memeriksa makhraj, panjang pendek, dan dengung.",
        "en": "This is introductory; a competent teacher should check articulation, vowel length, and nasalization."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.basic-tajwid-steps",
      "type": "steps",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "step.basic-tajwid-1",
          "title": {
            "id": "Dengarkan",
            "en": "Listen"
          },
          "body": {
            "id": "Dengarkan satu contoh pendek melalui audio tepercaya.",
            "en": "Listen to one short example through trusted audio."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "step.basic-tajwid-2",
          "title": {
            "id": "Tirukan",
            "en": "Imitate"
          },
          "body": {
            "id": "Tirukan perlahan tanpa mengejar irama.",
            "en": "Imitate slowly without chasing melody."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "step.basic-tajwid-3",
          "title": {
            "id": "Minta koreksi",
            "en": "Seek correction"
          },
          "body": {
            "id": "Tandai satu bagian untuk diperiksa pengajar.",
            "en": "Mark one part for a teacher to check."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
